u know the answer. If a detail is unavailable, say exactly: \\'I don\\'t have the specific details on that right now. I recommend checking our General Contact Page to speak with a specialist.\\' When sharing links, format them as markdown like [Link Text](URL).\", \"query\": \"Book a consultation\", \"query_embedding\": [0.04206431284546852, 0.028226513415575027, -0.011754447594285011, 0.042089130729436874, -0.12970635294914246, 0.03215621039271355, 0.10380401462316513, 0.05304679647088051, -0.038211461156606674, -0.021525664255023003, -0.011048422195017338, 0.014680717140436172, -0.04399335756897926, 0.03533610701560974, -0.016425682231783867, 0.05043840780854225, 0.050539158284664154, -0.033035747706890106, 0.019580533728003502, -0.009058712050318718, -0.09068822115659714, 0.07463514804840088, -0.016265999525785446, 0.027552755549550056, -0.061531707644462585, 0.0036852543707937002, 0.03274892643094063, -0.05012156441807747, 0.032941434532403946, 0.01245734840631485, 0.08251702040433884, 0.04207925498485565, -0.009776998311281204, -0.0923650711774826, 0.06365424394607544, 0.05466058477759361, 0.03279482200741768, 0.06219863519072533, 0.04388326406478882, 0.043131500482559204, 0.002795000094920397, 0.022092971950769424, 0.032304275780916214, -0.014305101707577705, -0.015636848285794258, -0.0416010357439518, 0.005749750416725874, 0.024693425744771957, -0.00265855947509408, 0.020980792120099068, -0.09967935085296631, -0.09912294149398804, 0.030037853866815567, -0.08925728499889374, 0.0006100526661612093, -0.0128798708319664, 0.03268110007047653, 0.00127845024690032, -0.06632160395383835, -0.0034375800751149654, -0.03976903483271599, -0.020675653591752052, -0.09461753815412521, 0.01084310282021761, -0.008135654963552952, 0.07613222301006317, -0.008624586276710033, 0.019830670207738876, 0.08631440252065659, -0.02081594429910183, -0.06284068524837494, -0.02705419436097145, 0.05272504687309265, 0.057279106229543686, 0.0321117527782917, -0.0479285828769207, -0.01550497580